WEBVTT

00:14.340 --> 00:15.970
Mother...

00:17.680 --> 00:19.310
Mother!

00:21.980 --> 00:24.110
I love you.

00:25.350 --> 00:30.920
Now and forever, I shall always love you.

00:32.430 --> 00:34.050
Mother...

00:39.400 --> 00:41.030
Mother...

00:42.840 --> 00:50.580
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:50.580 --> 00:57.540
Towards a far, faraway place

01:10.900 --> 01:17.110
Blown by the wind, we walk on

01:17.110 --> 01:24.070
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:24.280 --> 01:30.590
Even if a time of loss should come

01:30.590 --> 01:37.720
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:40.160 --> 01:47.570
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:47.570 --> 01:53.540
Towards something we can't lose

01:53.540 --> 02:01.180
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

02:01.180 --> 02:08.050
Towards a far, faraway place

02:15.200 --> 02:18.560
Episode 25
Prelude to Battle

02:33.180 --> 02:35.650
I'll bake a lot, so keep those coming, okay?

02:59.040 --> 03:01.840
What? An invitation from Neotopia?

03:01.840 --> 03:03.510
It's not from Noah?

03:03.510 --> 03:04.780
That's right.

03:04.780 --> 03:08.350
It's from Holy Father Hyrum, who rules Neotopia.

03:08.350 --> 03:11.890
Holy Father? What the heck's that about?

03:11.890 --> 03:13.660
Now, now, hold your horses.

03:13.660 --> 03:16.280
The Council will explain the details.

03:20.160 --> 03:25.530
A Joust with competitors from all the
territories is going to be held in Neotopia.

03:25.530 --> 03:27.300
A Joust?

03:27.300 --> 03:32.170
Robès and Zed, invitations have arrived
requesting your participation.

03:32.170 --> 03:35.080
After all, Robès is Templar's shard champion,

03:35.080 --> 03:38.850
and Zed has done distinguished service
as escort for the escapee.

03:38.850 --> 03:40.680
They want me?

03:40.680 --> 03:43.420
A Joust now?

03:43.420 --> 03:45.890
How very carefree.

03:45.890 --> 03:49.360
It is true that right now battles are
unfolding across all the lands

03:49.360 --> 03:51.260
as each territory vies for supremacy.

03:51.260 --> 03:56.600
However, if all lands work together
to make the Joust a success,

03:56.600 --> 03:59.970
it may open up a way to world peace.

03:59.970 --> 04:04.510
And in fact, all wars are to be suspended
during the Joust.

04:04.510 --> 04:06.540
It's a sacred cease-fire.

04:06.540 --> 04:10.080
Philanthropy and harmony are the
guiding principles of Templar.

04:10.080 --> 04:14.040
We have a responsibility and a duty to
contribute towards world peace.

04:14.980 --> 04:20.440
Well? Will you enter the Joust as
representatives of Templar?

04:21.190 --> 04:26.190
I don't much care for this " representing"
and " responsibility" stuff...

04:26.190 --> 04:27.990
I'll do it.

04:28.700 --> 04:31.800
I don't care, as long as I get to go to Neotopia.

04:31.800 --> 04:33.930
I want to see Noah.

04:47.020 --> 04:51.480
This is the result of seeking the greatest
happiness for all citizens?

05:07.800 --> 05:11.760
Lady Diana, we have meted punishment
on all the resistance fighters.

05:12.810 --> 05:14.440
Good work.

05:14.440 --> 05:16.740
Noah, what of your task?

05:16.740 --> 05:18.480
No problems.

05:18.480 --> 05:20.850
We will take care of everything else.

05:20.850 --> 05:22.920
Return to base at once.

05:22.920 --> 05:25.220
Yes, ma'am.

05:25.220 --> 05:26.950
Noah...

05:26.950 --> 05:31.730
The Resistance is becoming more active
with the Joust approaching.

05:31.730 --> 05:34.600
In order to safely hold the Joust,

05:34.600 --> 05:38.200
as well as to secure the safety
of civilian life here,

05:38.200 --> 05:41.970
we must eradicate the Resistance.

05:41.970 --> 05:43.200
Yes, ma'am.

05:43.200 --> 05:47.740
Please continue to lend us your aid, Noah.

05:47.740 --> 05:50.810
It will be my pleasure, ma'am.

05:50.810 --> 05:54.120
Kira, I ask for your aid as well.

05:54.120 --> 05:56.080
Y..Yes, ma'am.

05:58.120 --> 06:00.090
A Joust, eh?

06:00.090 --> 06:04.390
Zed, I think we'll finally have time
to really catch up.

06:18.310 --> 06:20.740
A Joust in Neotopia, eh?

06:20.740 --> 06:25.010
Am I the only one who thinks that
will be nothing but a farce?

06:25.010 --> 06:27.850
Quite, however...

06:27.850 --> 06:32.420
In that case, please, let me enter the farce.

06:32.420 --> 06:34.050
Nudyu?

06:37.760 --> 06:43.600
Are you saying you're qualified to
represent Zymot in the Joust?

06:43.600 --> 06:49.100
More so than the person wielding a useless
spirit named " Zakua, " at least.

06:49.100 --> 06:51.670
You lowlife, don't you get impudent with me!

06:51.670 --> 06:54.140
Oh dear, my apologies.

06:55.910 --> 06:59.370
What do you want out of
participating in the Joust?

07:00.210 --> 07:02.180
Power and glory.

07:02.180 --> 07:06.310
And one day, the king's throne on which you sit.

07:10.660 --> 07:11.890
Very well...

07:11.890 --> 07:15.530
It appears you have the Zymot spirit.

07:15.530 --> 07:19.000
Demonstrate that strength of yours in the Joust.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.630
Sire!

07:21.640 --> 07:26.600
That damn Nudyu's gotten cocky just because
he was promoted to fill Glaudio's job.

07:27.070 --> 07:28.700
Elmeida...

07:29.540 --> 07:32.280
You go to Neotopia as well.

07:32.280 --> 07:34.080
Why do I have to go too?!

07:38.990 --> 07:41.450
That nasty smile of yours...

07:42.160 --> 07:46.620
What scheme do you want to
use this farce for, Hugh?

08:15.760 --> 08:17.550
That's far enough!

08:19.290 --> 08:21.260
What are your names?

08:22.300 --> 08:24.260
My name is Geh-Geh.

08:26.370 --> 08:29.200
I am called Jeba.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.840
Geh-Geh and Jeba...

08:30.840 --> 08:35.210
You two will be the ones to
participate in the Joust.

08:35.210 --> 08:37.180
Thank you, sire.

08:38.010 --> 08:42.280
We beastmen, who are born with
shards within our bodies,

08:42.280 --> 08:44.850
are children of the shards!

08:44.850 --> 08:46.720
That means, in other words,

08:46.720 --> 08:51.180
that we are the closest blood relatives
of the Great Tusker.

08:51.830 --> 08:55.960
So, the beastmen, then, must always
be the strongest of warriors!

08:55.960 --> 09:00.200
Make all the territories fall before our feet!

09:00.200 --> 09:01.830
Sire!

09:04.040 --> 09:07.670
Ulvarx

09:21.160 --> 09:22.780
Dr. Vendar!

09:25.890 --> 09:28.360
Helic, Moreno...

09:29.630 --> 09:34.240
It has been officially decided that the
two of us will be sent to the Joust.

09:34.240 --> 09:35.600
Is that so?

09:35.600 --> 09:39.670
This is a golden opportunity to
test Ulvarx's technology.

09:39.670 --> 09:43.010
How far will you be able to go against
first-rate shard casters?

09:43.010 --> 09:46.610
I expect great things.

09:46.610 --> 09:50.080
We shall prove the scientific might of Ulvarx.

09:50.080 --> 09:55.420
We will crush shard casters from all the lands,
and obtain valuable data.

09:55.420 --> 09:56.860
A Joust, eh?

09:56.860 --> 09:59.090
Sounds entertaining.

09:59.090 --> 10:00.360
Ginga...

10:00.360 --> 10:02.560
You're back?!

10:02.560 --> 10:03.970
Yup...

10:03.970 --> 10:07.420
I just got home, but I'll come along for the ride.

10:10.140 --> 10:12.610
Roya, I'm sorry.

10:14.540 --> 10:19.080
I bear the responsibility for causing
you so much pain.

10:19.080 --> 10:23.020
I humbly ask you to forgive me.

10:23.020 --> 10:27.790
No, Master Zico, you took me in and raised me.

10:27.790 --> 10:29.590
You're like a father to me.

10:29.590 --> 10:31.390
I'm grateful.

10:31.960 --> 10:33.630
Roya...

10:33.630 --> 10:35.600
So, shall we eat?

10:39.530 --> 10:41.300
Say, Roya...

10:41.300 --> 10:44.270
Would you like to try your hand at the Joust?

10:45.270 --> 10:50.400
You've been invited along with Zed,
because of the jailbreak incident.

10:52.110 --> 10:55.280
But I couldn't do it as I am now.

10:55.280 --> 10:59.020
I don't have a sense of myself at all.

10:59.020 --> 11:00.720
I see...

11:00.720 --> 11:03.220
Well, don't rush your decision.

11:03.220 --> 11:06.430
Take your time and think it over.

11:06.430 --> 11:08.050
All right.

11:20.910 --> 11:22.540
Zed?

11:28.680 --> 11:30.720
What are you doing?

11:30.720 --> 11:34.220
When I look at familiar scenery
upside-down like this,

11:34.220 --> 11:37.020
it looks like I'm in a different place.

11:39.760 --> 11:44.870
I always wanted to leave Calm, the town
where I was born and raised.

11:44.870 --> 11:47.800
And as fate would have it, I've come to Templar,

11:47.800 --> 11:51.760
met lots of people and experienced lots of things.

11:53.710 --> 11:56.710
But I don't have any regrets,

11:56.710 --> 11:59.680
because everything I've done was my decision.

12:01.180 --> 12:04.390
You're so strong, Zed.

12:04.390 --> 12:06.120
Huh?

12:06.120 --> 12:07.820
You're going to enter the Joust, right?

12:07.820 --> 12:11.280
Yeah, will you?

12:14.360 --> 12:15.730
I see...

12:15.730 --> 12:18.860
Well, whatever, it's up to you.

12:21.900 --> 12:23.700
Good luck!

12:27.310 --> 12:30.910
" Whatever, it's up to you, " huh?

12:30.910 --> 12:32.880
That's all I ever hear.

12:34.280 --> 12:36.580
Every so often, I'd like...

12:46.290 --> 12:50.870
Diana, what is the status of our
representative athletes?

12:50.870 --> 12:54.160
I'm considering candidates, mainly
focusing on the Neoknights.

12:55.570 --> 13:00.070
I rely on you to make sure we are not
outdone by another territory.

13:00.070 --> 13:02.040
Understood, Your Holiness.

13:09.880 --> 13:12.890
We are wishing you both luck.

13:12.890 --> 13:17.850
Do not forget that you carry the honor and
dignity of Templar on your shoulders.

13:18.730 --> 13:22.030
I'm telling you, let's lay off of that stuff.

13:22.560 --> 13:25.030
So, Roya really isn't coming...

13:29.500 --> 13:31.130
Roya...

13:35.340 --> 13:38.310
Master Zico, I...

13:39.580 --> 13:41.820
You don't have to say anything.

13:41.820 --> 13:43.880
Fight well.

13:43.880 --> 13:45.510
Yes!

13:50.720 --> 13:53.630
Go get them, Roya!

13:53.630 --> 13:56.100
Thanks, Mickey.

14:04.510 --> 14:06.300
They're gone...

14:06.970 --> 14:10.270
Roya, fight well.

14:17.320 --> 14:18.690
Noah!

14:18.690 --> 14:20.860
What is it, Sagiri?

14:20.860 --> 14:23.020
I made you a good-luck charm.

14:23.020 --> 14:26.030
You're going to be in that " Joust"
competition, right?

14:26.030 --> 14:29.150
I made this for you so that you won't get hurt!

14:30.160 --> 14:32.790
I'm sorry, but I can't accept that.

14:34.940 --> 14:38.970
I have the doctrine of Absolute Law.

14:38.970 --> 14:42.480
I'm being protected and supported by the law.

14:42.480 --> 14:45.600
So, I don't need that thing.

14:46.580 --> 14:48.480
Noah...

14:48.480 --> 14:50.450
I'm grateful for the thought though.

14:50.450 --> 14:52.580
Thank you, Sagiri.

14:55.090 --> 14:58.390
Noah, Lady Diana is calling for you.

14:58.390 --> 15:00.230
All right...

15:00.230 --> 15:02.200
I'll be there as soon as I've changed clothes.

15:05.170 --> 15:09.300
Apparently, the competitors from
Templar just arrived.

15:10.040 --> 15:12.570
They're here already?

15:12.570 --> 15:17.200
Yes, and someone named " Zed" is
saying that he wants to see you.

15:18.080 --> 15:19.380
Right...

15:19.380 --> 15:21.320
Do you know him?

15:21.320 --> 15:23.080
We're good friends.

15:23.080 --> 15:25.790
You and a shard caster from Templar?!

15:25.790 --> 15:30.020
He's not originally from Templar.

15:30.020 --> 15:35.330
He's from another world completely different
than this one, the same as me.

15:36.000 --> 15:38.030
A different world?

15:38.030 --> 15:40.160
Noah, are you...

15:46.640 --> 15:48.270
Zed!

15:49.080 --> 15:50.700
Noah!

15:56.520 --> 15:59.850
Zed, I missed you.

15:59.850 --> 16:02.150
Yeah, I missed you too.

16:07.900 --> 16:11.100
Is your health okay?

16:11.100 --> 16:16.370
Yeah, I'm not completely healed,
but the shards have done a lot.

16:16.370 --> 16:18.010
Oh...

16:18.010 --> 16:21.310
Anyway, I was sure surprised
when I saw you in Tusk!

16:21.310 --> 16:24.280
I never imagined you'd come to this world too!

16:25.680 --> 16:27.650
I was just as surprised.

16:33.150 --> 16:36.610
I'd been wondering what had
happened to you after that.

16:37.560 --> 16:40.860
A lot has happened since I came to this world...

16:42.500 --> 16:47.800
So many things I could never tell you
all about it in one day, Noah.

16:50.500 --> 16:54.630
I've got all kinds of things I want
to tell you about too.

17:04.220 --> 17:07.850
What's the point of me being in this Joust?

17:09.090 --> 17:12.060
Me, a representative of Templar?

17:21.000 --> 17:22.800
Thank you.

17:25.770 --> 17:29.240
You're going to be in the Joust?

17:29.240 --> 17:32.280
Yeah, for what it's worth.

17:32.280 --> 17:34.850
Where are you from?

17:34.850 --> 17:37.550
I'm from a country called " Templar" .

17:37.550 --> 17:39.350
These days anyway...

17:41.390 --> 17:43.020
Me too...

17:44.060 --> 17:47.730
I'm not from this country either.

17:47.730 --> 17:51.360
I got separated from all of my people.

17:53.030 --> 17:54.830
Oh, I see.

17:58.170 --> 18:00.470
Hey, let me see that.

18:01.910 --> 18:03.710
Here goes!

18:04.110 --> 18:06.580
Wow, it flies pretty well, huh?

18:07.980 --> 18:12.440
I wish I could fly too, and go to
where my people are.

18:26.870 --> 18:31.370
You know, I'm happy I've come to this world.

18:31.370 --> 18:35.330
Because it's let me obtain the
same strength you have.

18:36.310 --> 18:38.280
Noah...

18:38.280 --> 18:42.380
Zed, do you know about " key spirits" ?

18:42.380 --> 18:45.450
No, not the details anyway.

18:45.450 --> 18:48.960
Apparently, there are only a small
number of them in this world.

18:48.960 --> 18:51.390
So, you know about them?!

18:51.390 --> 18:53.360
I don't know all the details,

18:53.360 --> 19:00.400
but the story is that when all the key spirits
are gathered, this world will end.

19:00.400 --> 19:03.340
" End" ? It'll be over?!

19:03.340 --> 19:04.340
Who knows?

19:04.340 --> 19:06.970
I don't think they mean it that way though.

19:11.280 --> 19:13.510
It's a shame, but it's time for me to go back.

19:13.510 --> 19:16.140
Why?! Can't you stay a while longer?

19:17.150 --> 19:19.120
When the bell rings, I go back.

19:20.290 --> 19:22.620
That's the law.

19:22.620 --> 19:24.250
Noah...

19:26.130 --> 19:27.660
I have to go now.

19:27.660 --> 19:31.170
I want to stay with you some more,
but I'd get in trouble.

19:31.170 --> 19:32.770
Can I see you again?

19:32.770 --> 19:34.130
Of course!

19:34.130 --> 19:36.930
I'd like to see you again too, Sagiri.

19:39.710 --> 19:41.340
Roya...

19:41.340 --> 19:42.610
Yes?

19:42.610 --> 19:45.150
You're going to be in the Joust, right?

19:45.150 --> 19:46.770
Here...

19:47.380 --> 19:49.120
Oh, how cute!

19:49.120 --> 19:50.450
A good-luck charm?

19:50.450 --> 19:53.150
I had someone I wanted to give it to,

19:53.150 --> 19:56.490
but he said he didn't want it.

19:56.490 --> 20:03.120
So, I thought if you'd take it, I'd be really happy.

20:04.630 --> 20:07.570
Is it really all right for me to have it?

20:07.570 --> 20:09.440
You'll take it?

20:09.440 --> 20:11.230
Of course!

20:13.040 --> 20:14.670
Thank you!

20:24.180 --> 20:28.140
Your Holiness, I have brought the five
representatives of Neotopia.

20:29.490 --> 20:33.990
The reason we venture to hold a
Joust now here in Neotopia

20:33.990 --> 20:36.800
is to deepen the understanding between nations,

20:36.800 --> 20:39.930
and so pave the way to world peace.

20:40.770 --> 20:43.700
You guardians of the law who stand before me...

20:43.700 --> 20:49.170
That shall surely be achieved when you show
yourselves to be stronger than all others.

20:50.340 --> 20:53.980
I expect great things from you.

20:53.980 --> 20:55.780
Diana...

20:55.780 --> 20:56.920
Of course!

20:56.920 --> 20:59.320
Noah, stand before His Holiness.

20:59.320 --> 21:00.950
Yes, ma'am.

21:07.590 --> 21:11.720
What do you now consider your
place in this world to be?

21:12.730 --> 21:19.240
My place is as a martyr to and
an incarnation of the Neotopian ethos.

21:19.240 --> 21:23.540
And is the same true of your power?

21:23.540 --> 21:28.500
Yes, I consider it something to preserve
order and peace.

21:30.650 --> 21:32.750
Very well...

21:32.750 --> 21:37.720
You were summoned here as the one
who will save this country.

21:37.720 --> 21:43.030
Put that power to good use for
the sake of Neotopia.

21:43.030 --> 21:48.990
Yes, all is for Neotopia's sake, and
for Your Holiness's sake.

21:54.540 --> 21:57.280
You're a strange person.

21:57.280 --> 21:58.710
Me?

21:58.710 --> 22:00.340
Yes.

22:00.850 --> 22:04.250
You have a shard caster friend in Templar,

22:04.250 --> 22:07.690
and Holy Father Hyrum treats you as a savior.

22:07.690 --> 22:10.820
Not only that, you're from another world.

22:12.990 --> 22:16.450
Exactly who are you?

22:17.960 --> 22:19.800
That day...

22:19.800 --> 22:22.800
Yes, it all started on that day.

22:22.800 --> 22:25.330
The gears of my fate began to turn.

22:42.020 --> 22:44.620
Open the hands you have over your face

22:44.620 --> 22:47.460
It looks like you'll be done in by the sun

22:47.460 --> 22:52.420
Let's let the sky melt away our melancholy

22:52.770 --> 22:58.410
We stripped off our heavy jackets
and started running, 6, 7, 8

22:58.410 --> 23:04.370
So, we'll make the wind blow in this
windless place, and take off! Go!

23:09.420 --> 23:14.820
I'm shaken awake, head spinning,
and sunlight hits me the next moment

23:14.820 --> 23:18.620
The rain's abatement lets loose dreams

23:20.330 --> 23:23.060
We'll dash down this path

23:23.060 --> 23:30.530
Search for the one-and-only "now"
and our heartbeats

23:31.200 --> 23:33.870
Thrust out our clasped hands

23:33.870 --> 23:36.640
It looks like we could even shatter the sun

23:36.640 --> 23:41.600
Let's launch our melancholy into the sky

23:42.120 --> 23:47.650
Try again, step forward, if we're hesitating 7, 8, 9

23:47.650 --> 23:53.790
We'll shout loud enough to echo
to Cloud Ten, and go!

24:16.580 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Lonely Memories

24:17.580 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Lonely Memories"
